            "kind": "TRIVIAL_REBASE",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 26,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Unive Tien",
                        "email": "unive.tien.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "UniveTien"
                    },
                    "message": "This is causing ODR violation, since there're more than one [use cases] of this method but the definition is written in the header file.\n\n[use cases]: https://github.com/openbmc/pldm/blob/4bf3ed840f13c31720ffa7c255942f3836402f4f/platform-mc/terminus_manager.cpp#L423"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 34,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "What is this??  We should not be catching (or throwing) integers."
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 34,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "P Arun Kumar Reddy",
                        "email": "arunpapannagari23@gmail.com",
                        "username": "arun-reddy23"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 47,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Isn't this a potential race condition?  You potentially have two threads interacting with this as if it were a global variable."
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 47,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "P Arun Kumar Reddy",
                        "email": "arunpapannagari23@gmail.com",
                        "username": "arun-reddy23"
                    },
                    "message": "Ack, I've removed the member variable and passing the vector of EIDs directly to the function"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 56,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "We really shouldn't be doing sync_wait.  That means this becomes a blocking point for all of the code."
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 56,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "P Arun Kumar Reddy",
                        "email": "arunpapannagari23@gmail.com",
                        "username": "arun-reddy23"
                    },
                    "message": "This"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 153,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Why is this a co-routine when there is no `co_await` in it?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 153,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "P Arun Kumar Reddy",
                        "email": "arunpapannagari23@gmail.com",
                        "username": "arun-reddy23"
                    },
                    "message": "Ack, I've changed these functions to remove the coroutine implementation"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.hpp",
                    "line": 63,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "I don't know how `exec::` works here, but I'd prefer we use `sdbusplus::async::task`."
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.hpp",
                    "line": 63,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "P Arun Kumar Reddy",
                        "email": "arunpapannagari23@gmail.com",
                        "username": "arun-reddy23"
                    },
                    "message": "sdbusplus::async is is a namespace wrapper around exec::, I've replaced exec:: with sdbusplus::async"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.hpp",
                    "line": 183,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "co-routines taking a reference is almost always wrong.  How do you know the lifetime of the Request lasts through the end of the co-routine's execution?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/inventory_manager.hpp",
                    "line": 183,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "P Arun Kumar Reddy",
                        "email": "arunpapannagari23@gmail.com",
                        "username": "arun-reddy23"
                    },
                    "message": "I've removed it from being a reference. However, similar changes are required in `terminus_manager.cpp` as well\n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/pldm/blob/f264c08d50359f68e90dfeb22c3b4cb62d198c66/platform-mc/terminus_manager.cpp#L415"
                }
            ],
